The compatible system $\{\rho_\lambda\}$ is rectangular by the condition \ref{cor1.8}(c).
Hence, Corollary \ref{cor1.8}(i) follows immediately from Theorem \ref{thm_main2}.
Since $\rho_{\lambda_0}$ is absolutely irreducible (\ref{cor1.8}(c)),
