From \cite[Theorem 1.1]{Chambole}, $u_p$ converges uniformly to a function $u_{\infty}\in C^{0,\alpha}(\overline \Omega)$ which is a viscosity solution to the H\"older (or fractional) infinity Laplace equation (we can see this operator $L$ as the limit of $L_p$ when $p \to \infty$): 
