	\caption{\label{fig_3S} Solutions of nonlinear pendulum using simple and exact forms in Eq.(\ref{eq_swinging})-Eq.(\ref{eq_spinning}), with  phase constant $\delta = 0$. Physical constants $2\pi \sqrt{\frac{L}{g}} = 1\text{ second}$ is used throughout.}
