We recall the following standard lemma. 

\begin{lem}\label{lem: truncated energy}
    Let $\nu$ be a finitely supported probability measure on $\R^d$. Assume that for some $Z\in \R^d$ we have 
    \[
    \hat\eng_{\delta,\nu}(Z)\leq R.
