\begin{prop}\label{prop:prop2}
    Let $0<\eta<\frac{1}{10}\eta_X$ and $0<100\varepsilon <\delta<1$. Suppose there exists $y_0\in X_{2\eta}\cap Y$ and $F\subset B_\mathfrak r (0,1)$ containing 0 so that $\exp(w)y_0\in X_{2\eta}\cap Y$ for every $w\in F$ and
