Effective anomaly detection methods include:

\begin{itemize}
    \item \textbf{Distance-based:} Mahalanobis or cosine distance to training clusters.
    \item \textbf{Density-based:} One-Class SVM, Local Outlier Factor, KDE.
    \item \textbf{Autoencoder-based:} Reconstruction loss for abnormality scoring.
    \item \textbf{LLM/VLM-based:} Use large models to estimate plausibility or predict feature consistency.
\end{itemize}
