Recent studies reveal risks of behavioral drift. For example,~\cite{chen2024chatgpt} find that GPT-4's instruction-following ability declined over time, highlighting the need for ongoing monitoring.
%
Performance degradation in LLMs/VLMs may result from knowledge staleness, hallucination, catastrophic forgetting, or few-shot performance decay. Empirical evidence~\cite{payne2024performance,bhayana2023performance,jeong2024limited} shows that GPT-4's diagnostic accuracy dropped within months across both text and image tasks.
%
As these models play a growing role in clinical decision-making, monitoring their performance is a critical and promising research direction.
