\end{equation}
where $y$ is the coordinate on the $\mathbb{C}$-factor. Orlov proved that the category of singularities of the LG model $\left(\hat Y,\hat{\cal W}\right)$ is equivalent to $D$Coh$\left({\cal W}^{^{-1}}(0)\ =\ Z\ \subset\ Y\right)$.

