be the associated moment map, and let $L_{_u}\overset{def.}{=}\mu^{^{-1}}(u)\subset\mathbb{CP^{^1}}$ be the moment fiber Lagrangian over an interior point $u\in(0,1)$. By identifying $L_{_u}$ with $S^{^1}$ via the $S^{^1}$-action, we choose an orientation of $L_{_u}$ such that it is compatible with that of $S^{^1}$. 

Let  

