Take a closed $S^{^1}$-invariant 1-form 

\begin{equation}  
\mathfrak{b}\ =\ \mathfrak{b}_{_o}\ +\ \mathfrak{b}_{_+} 
\end{equation}
where   

\begin{equation}  
\mathfrak{b}_{_o}\ \in\ \Omega^{^1}(L_{_u})\ \ \ \ \ \ \ ,\ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \mathfrak{b}_{_+}\ \in\ \Omega^{^1}(L_{_u})\hat\otimes_{_\mathbb{C}}\ \Lambda_{_+}  
