\end{figure}  

Under $\Phi$, a flat vector bundle on a Lagrangian submanifold goes to the corresponding cycle in the middle cohomology $H^{^n}(A,\mathbb{Q})$. Such Lagrangians belong to the kernel of a surjective map  

