\end{equation}  
where 

\begin{equation}  
\mathbb{T}\ =\ \Gamma\ \oplus\ \Sigma\ \oplus\ \Gamma^{^*}.  
\end{equation}

The torus $T$ has natural projection $p$ and $q$ to the tori $A$ and $B$,  


\begin{equation}  
