where ${\cal E}$ and ${\cal F}$ are objects of $D^{^b}(X\times Y)$. 

${\cal F}\boxtimes{\cal E}$ denotes the object 

\begin{equation}   
p_{_{13}}^{^*}({\cal F})\ \otimes\ p^{^*}_{_{24}}({\cal E})  
