    for some $\tilde\theta$ whose components $\theta_i =  (1 - t_i)\hat\theta_{n,i} + t_i2\gamma_n(x_\alpha -1/2) $ for some $t_i \in [0,1]$ for all $i \in [p]$, ignoring the first terms gives the first result.
